# Daily Bugle Building's Smear Campaign: "Target legendary creature" is either player's legendary creature, and no non-legendary creature. Bot2 casts Thalia, Guardian of Thraben on
# turn 2; at the end of that turn, with {1} from Mox Ruby floating, Bot1 cannot target her: it is not a sorcery window (Bot2's turn). On turn 3 Bot1, with {1} from Mox Emerald,
# cannot target its own Ornithopter (not legendary), and gives Bot2's Thalia menace.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Daily Bugle Building
Plains x3
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Thalia, Guardian of Thraben
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Daily Bugle Building.Play
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Thalia, Guardian of Thraben.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.End]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
! Bot1.Battlefield.Daily Bugle Building.Activate(Ability: Smear Campaign; Bot2.Battlefield.Thalia, Guardian of Thraben)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
! Bot1.Battlefield.Daily Bugle Building.Activate(Ability: Smear Campaign; Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Daily Bugle Building.Activate(Ability: Smear Campaign; Bot2.Battlefield.Thalia, Guardian of Thraben)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Thalia, Guardian of Thraben.Keywords = FirstStrike; Menace

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Daily Bugle Building.Tapped = true
